{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>For with You is the fountain of life</b> — the life of the supernal soul, that does not die." "<b>In Your light we see light</b> — an epithet for the reward of the world to come, for there is nothing in this world more honored than light, and it is a substance and not a body."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 36, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:29:47.721757178Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}